00:06:06.050 --> 00:06:11.266
I want a MongoDB
setup already for me.

00:06:11.266 --> 00:06:13.640
So we have a tool that can do
that called Cloud Launcher.

00:06:13.640 --> 00:06:15.990
We have images
that are available.

00:06:15.990 --> 00:06:19.190
So for many and most
common software packages,

00:06:19.190 --> 00:06:22.220
you're just going to be able
to go there and load them up.

00:06:22.220 --> 00:06:23.600
Now, we don't
manage them for you

00:06:23.600 --> 00:06:25.610
after you've run them
in Cloud Launcher.

00:06:25.610 --> 00:06:28.680
It's as if basically
you spun up a VM,

00:06:28.680 --> 00:06:32.540
did all the configuration work,
and you're at the same spot.

00:06:32.540 --> 00:06:34.490
So it's just a jumpstart.

